slider23:0<0,1,1{Bypass,On}>-Trem On
55 -> 24
slider24:50<0,100,1->-Mix
slider25:1<0,4,1{OFF, One, Two, One+Two, Knobs, Knobs+ Ext LFO}>-Chorus
slider26:0<-24,24,.1>-Output (dB)
slider27:0<0,1,1{1 Stage, 2 Stages}>-Stages
